Package: fugazi.db
Title: Primary Data for the Fugazi Live Series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alex", "Mitrani", , "27974470+alexmitrani@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1091-7413"))
Description: 'fugazi.db' is a data-only package of primary source data on the
    Fugazi Live Series - show listings, venue coordinates, tag/duration data,
    and discography metadata - scraped or hand-curated from
    <https://www.dischord.com/fugazi_live_series> and other sources. It
    contains no processing code; see the 'Repeatr' package
    (<https://github.com/alexmitrani/Repeatr>) for the functions that clean,
    classify, and model this data.
